    mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml instead, which layers the same artwork so both look alike.

    A vector rather than the usual density-bucketed PNGs: the shape is a handful of arcs, and
    shipping one file keeps the two variants from drifting apart.
-->
